  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #333399;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Stock Markets and Financial Awareness</span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Dept. of MCA &amp; The Dept. of MBA, jointly organized a Webinar on \" Stock Markets and Financial Awareness\" in Association with Proficient Minds sponsored by National Securities Depository Ltd., held on July 21, 2025, in the Dept. of MCA - seminar hall, the session featured by Mr. Suhas Rajput as the distinguished speaker and commenced at 11:30 AM, providing valuable insights into the dynamics of the stock market and fundamental principles of personal finance.</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">&nbsp;</span></h5>\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"alignleft\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ATMECE_MCA_Webinar-Report-of-NSDL.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"alignright\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Program-Report-on-WeninarStock-Market.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]",
